{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322112001:0":{"text":"你们回来了！圣瓦勒沙教堂那里如何了？","source_cn":"你们回来了！圣瓦勒沙教堂那里如何了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D3BC465D7A5EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1322112001":{"text":"你们回来了！圣瓦勒沙教堂那里如何了？","source_cn":"你们回来了！圣金嘉教堂那里如何了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D3BC465D7A5EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322112002:1":{"text":"这……这该怎么办……","source_cn":"这……这该怎么办……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C7938CE085C4C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322112003:0":{"text":"我们驱逐了那些活死人，现在圣瓦勒沙教堂应该很安全。","source_cn":"我们驱逐了那些活死人，现在圣瓦勒沙教堂应该很安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA306E7C10ABA5A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322112005:1":{"text":"噢，艾雅保佑！实在是太感谢了，你们果然是女神派来的使者！","source_cn":"噢，艾雅保佑！实在是太感谢了，你们果然是女神派来的使者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86CDBA9538D53C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322112006:1":{"text":"其实是卡列琳娜发觉修道院人手不足，请我们来帮忙的……","source_cn":"其实是卡列琳娜发觉修道院人手不足，请我们来帮忙的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86D455A1ED289E4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322112007:1":{"text":"卡列琳娜？原谅我，我实在记不得所有镇民的名字，但她一定是位虔诚善良的人，愿艾雅保佑她！","source_cn":"卡列琳娜？原谅我，我实在记不得所有镇民的名字，但她一定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AD85E77A2B051AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322112008:1":{"text":"有许多事情我们现在没有力量去做，但圣堂一定会再派更多人手来的。我们也会尽全力维持好修道院的日常运转。","source_cn":"有许多事情我们现在没有力量去做，但圣堂一定会再派更多人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1AF480E6F483CF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322112009:1":{"text":"无论如何，再次感谢你们无私的帮助。","source_cn":"无论如何，再次感谢你们无私的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x867808F8AE356D7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"不太好，有很多活死人","source_cn":"不太好，有很多活死人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x284E7E44BE6198CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"不太好，有很多活死人","female":"不太好，有很多活死人","variant_male_record_index":"69436","variant_female_record_index":"69437","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322112004:1":{"text":"嘿嘿